comments[10]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-15T15:47:50.043Z",codex-sol,"Required checks are test (22), test (26), codeql; CodeQL remains unfiltered. Main CI run 43679596301: queue-inclusive jobs 575s/961s; slowest repeated cases public-quality replay 48s, SDK admission 27s. Explicit temporary tracker roots and scoped Git/PM environment scrubbing address #116. Quick uses deterministic seed prefixes; full and all coverage thresholds remain unchanged. Release files are excluded."
  "2026-11-15T15:51:48.061Z",codex-sol,"Strict tracker health passed with six pre-existing stale-item advisories. Strict YAML parse passed for all three workflows; actionlint is unavailable. Typecheck, test typecheck and docstring checks passed. Linked lint caught a dynamic import in a new regression; replaced it with a static import and reran. Quick coverage is bounded to twenty minutes locally; no full-depth run is requested here."
  "2026-11-15T15:56:45.776Z",codex-sol,"Touched quick suites passed 136 tests, zero failures, 495.052s wall time on the contended development host (not comparable to hosted execution). Additional docs/identity/provenance suites passed 39/39; fixture regression and scale validation passed 5/5; final fixed product-timeout transport suite passed 7/7. Typecheck/lint linked run passed in 45.061s; test typecheck, docstrings, strict health, attestation and YAML validation passed. Quick coverage remains running within its twenty-minute watchdog. Pushing early; no CI wait is requested."
  "2026-11-15T16:04:49.173Z",codex-sol,"Quick coverage passed: 452 tests, zero failures, 49 source files reported; 100% statements/branches/functions/lines at unchanged thresholds. Suite wall 842.784s; entire coverage command approximately 889s (14m49s). Full depth was not run locally; baseline hosted full npm gate was 141s and repeated Bun gate 138s, which are not comparable to this contended host. Final real initialized-parent fixture regressions passed 5/5; final packed Node-only smoke passed; final lint passed. First PR #119 CI run 43732684592 remains queued; no PR wall completion measurement exists, and CI is not awaited. All testTime uses were audited: SDK/product deadlines stay unscaled, including the 20ms SDK client deadline. Claim released after verification; item remains in progress for orchestrator review."
  "2026-11-15T18:50:22.549Z",codex-sol,"Round C: verify the supplied review findings, repair failing checks, audit CI tier boundaries and harness controls, and run focused gates. Review threads remain untouched; no merge or closure."
  "2026-11-15T18:56:53.954Z",codex-sol,"Failed run 43733442907 reached changelog checking: the in-progress CI item was missing. Docs finding is valid: parse published calibration evidence on the cheap path; execute the actual command against valid and malformed JSON. Self-review checks documentation/privacy/identity gates, unscaled product budgets, integer timeouts, validation before spawn, platform filenames and generated-only quick thresholds."
  "2026-11-15T19:03:56.612Z",codex-sol,"Round C validation passed: typecheck, test TypeScript compilation, focused behavior and workflow/tooling suites, strict unique-key YAML parsing, and package changelog regeneration/check. Lint passed where the package provides a lint script; packages without one passed their existing docstring gate. No configured coverage source changed, so no package coverage run was added. Existing isolated coverage-tooling fixtures are part of the focused tooling suites. All supplied review findings are valid and repaired. Self-review additionally preserves executable tracker scans and all applicable docs/privacy/identity/package/attestation gates. Product budgets and coverage thresholds remain unchanged. Validation uses the local Node 24 runtime; Node 22/26, native Windows and deep runtime certification remain CI evidence. Threads untouched; no merge or item closure. Release ownership after recording this evidence."
  "2026-11-15T22:24:12.083Z",codex-sol,"Round E: verified assigned review findings and current checks. Fix valid portability, gate-order and timeout regressions; preserve product deadlines, privacy/identity and self-host gates. Run targeted quick tests and required tooling checks before an explicit-path commit. Review threads remain untouched."
  "2026-11-15T22:37:23.469Z",codex-sol,"Round E evidence: PRRT_kwDOU8IMzs63s2nE and PRRT_kwDOU8IMzs63t535 are valid. Execute the extracted Node expression directly; scrub GIT_COMMON_DIR from git init and withoutGit fixtures, with inherited common-directory restoration exercised. Targeted fixtures/workflow tests, typecheck, lint and YAML passed. Greptile failure is the review status, not an Actions test log."
  "2026-11-15T22:49:56.971Z",codex-sol,"Round E final verification: typecheck, lint (docstring gate where no lint script exists), touched regression tests, workflow/tooling tests, strict workflow YAML and changelog:check passed. Duplication gates passed where provided. Self-review retained docs/tracker privacy and identity checks, unscaled product deadlines, integer-rounded validated harness budgets, platform filename guards and generated-only quick thresholds. No package coverage sources were edited; no package coverage run. No review thread actions or merge. Shared-runner hold and unbrained commit identity will be checked before push. Hosted CI is intentionally not awaited."
